<title>INDIA: TABLE-India's TVS Suzuki 1996/97 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-India's TVS Suzuki 1996/97 net up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		543.6  vs    351.6</p>
<p>    Net sales	     8,299.3  vs  6,183.2</p>
<p>    Div (rupees)		3.5  vs	N/A</p>
<p>    Other income	     63.9  vs     45.9</p>
<p>    Total expenditure   7,305.2  vs  5,481.3</p>
<p>    Interest costs	   56.7  vs     48.2</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    144.6  vs     91.6</p>
<p>    Tax			 313.1  vs    256.4</p>
<p>NOTE: TVS Suzuki, a leading Indian manufacturer of scooters and motorcycles, said its market share in the two-wheeler industry grew to 17.3 percent from 15.5 percent in the previous year. Japan's Suzuki Motor Corp holds a 25.9 percent stake in the company.</p>
<p>--  New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
